Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Current stabilized core extracted from your framework", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"16ef1124-e6db-ef4a-8d2c-c4f20408dd1b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Ontological core", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"1ff50573-df5e-d149-896a-e8322e64f959"],

Cell["Existence is stabilization at scale.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"85d6e34b-74d0-5442-ba94-399663fe5833"],

Cell["Reality is recursively organized closure.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"8dcae062-78c6-f247-ab1a-eb5cc89ba661"],

Cell["\<\
Stable lower-scale structures compose higher-scale structures.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"c5c03a91-caba-5540-b4a3-bc40b22ffc6b"],

Cell["Higher-scale structures constrain lower-scale structures.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"33afc2b9-30d6-134b-915f-2ad291d2ac90"],

Cell["\<\
Time is the ordered trace of recursive self-measurement and stabilization.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6df59ff4-b5a3-7540-bb35-4494e05bfc6e"],

Cell["Memory is required for temporal continuity.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ac130022-8511-e94f-9cf9-762e931174e0"],

Cell["\<\
Consciousness is the interior side of sufficiently rich recursive \
self-measurement.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d2ec627d-4570-b042-a237-111e3f76ecf8"],

Cell["Matter is stabilized informational geometry.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"392000bf-a7e8-d64d-9276-58930fe40dfc"],

Cell["\<\
Mass is stabilization burden of information density at scale.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3968b654-75be-7e4b-8244-0140ba6797bc"],

Cell["Gravity is field response to dense stabilization burden.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"01eec513-f112-c942-b305-c29bd5ade125"],

Cell["\<\
Inertia is resistance to reconfiguration of stabilized informational \
structure.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b1e049f1-d74f-7e40-a052-e3035687d300"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Structural core", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"fdde4a11-137b-e748-a6bd-a377326a410b"],

Cell["\<\
Spherical closure means direction-complete bounded self-related closure, not \
literal roundness.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d08741eb-d774-0448-a48e-337e9a58de61"],

Cell["\<\
Fractality means recurrence of stabilization logic across scales, not just \
visual repetition.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"31f27d0f-fa4a-bb40-a5be-0dee967ad5c8"],

Cell["\<\
Geometry is constraint structure over possible stable relations.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b89c48cf-67db-f24d-884d-aaa983b9c464"],

Cell["\<\
Golden-ratio / Fibonacci organization is proposed as an efficient \
nonredundant recursive scan or growth law.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"4d52a56b-387f-cb4b-a82b-73b549ec3758"],

