become alive and measured  because they are possible .... everything is \
interwoven logic of the field trying to stabalize toward infinite dimensional \
frictionlessness at scale but more dense structures have more dense \
measurements and therefore has more phase drag , the reason why larger \
structures struggle to stabalize quickly  (it requires much more time and \
stabalizations/measurements) 

3. What exactly makes something stable? true dimensional frictionlessness and \
