brain in a stable method...  or a planet that can swing around its sun and \
its sun around its relative area .....essentially forever .... i theorize for \
example that there are infinite resonance spirals at infinite interwoven \
scales and great attractor is just a bigger galaxy that exists of  possibly \
octillions of actual galaxies .. we can call them Exalons for now.. 

4. What is measurement in the most precise sense? if you had to take the \
