according to previous measurements its rellative to b and c in its past and \
the next stable dimensional pathwayse in the multidimensional resonance field \
is its next possible mathematically stable pathways .. (like the 6 \
spheres/paths around a central sphere in metatrons cube essentially ) 

6. What exactly distinguishes matter from non-matter?

its just the simple mirrored stability , because its possible ,, if 01011 is \
possible so must 10100 be possible as its mirrored possibility essentially , \
because the inward and outward spirals of recursive entropy and meaasurement \
is also mirrored .... the opposite algorithms will cancel eachother out as \
the highest possible friction and disperment of its information and \
complexities (the stored memories/information within its scales  and internal \
densities and structures etc 

7. What is the strongest exact relation between \
ChatCodeInlineTemplate[information density] and mass?  the actual fields  \
formed of the densities of that wich seperates space from nothingness \
,,,becomes memorised as information by the field and this information becomes \
its density according to its total amount of planck scales merged throughout \
time ,,,eventually when quantum states of structures reach 0 vibration and \
