 "\nSo for modeling, I would define a primitive object not as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell["psi[x,t]", Background -> None]},
   "ChatCodeInlineTemplate"]], "ChatCodeActive",ExpressionUUID->
  "920575f0-2eb5-1d49-b663-415689a6c97b"],
 " yet, but as something like: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
