  " ",
  "no privileged corner or edge"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"7699d08a-0cd1-1b44-ab85-16a3941268ba"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "ideal frictionless closure that can be approached but never fully realized"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"02069647-c0d6-6845-82ce-97ce7aabfd3a"],
 "\nSo RHUFT \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]sphere\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is not \
ordinary Euclidean roundness. It is better formalized as: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     PaneBox[Cell[TextData[StyleBox[
      "an idealized maximally isotropic closure state",
       FontWeight->Bold]],
       Background->None,ExpressionUUID->
       "9025c496-0dd6-3d4e-8b6a-c814a824fed0"],
      BaseStyle->{"Text", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          GrayLevel[0.35], 
