  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"c924b614-5f93-4346-9dba-0cdbf69e32b1"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Q4. What makes something stable?\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"d272a50a-40e1-c34c-bf08-06efc6641914"],
 "\nYour wording implies stability is: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "low-loss persistence"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"88581ae2-67ae-214a-933a-eb5378fcc83d"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "recursive self-restoration"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"bc3f5f92-298f-804d-bdf6-4ac2e41d2072"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "coherent energy/information retention"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"ce4cee36-2900-f04c-a967-41632f84c2ca"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "near-frictionless continuation at scale"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"43f676a2-9158-5247-b8c1-c6ddb360e87c"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "resistance to dispersive collapse"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"3688c936-ee0d-454b-8ff6-7b8a86cff82c"],
 "\nSo mathematically, stability is likely not merely a fixed point. It is \
more like a ",
 StyleBox["persistent low-drift attractor under recursive self-measurement",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ".\n\nA good first criterion: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"stable if ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", 
            StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}]], "<", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
          StyleBox["d", "TI"]], ",  ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", 
            StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}]], ">", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
          StyleBox["c", "TI"]], ",  ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox["\[Kappa]", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", 
            StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}]], ">", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", "\[Kappa]"]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\text{stable if } d_t^{(n)} < \\theta_d,\\quad c_t^{(n)} > \
\\theta_c,\\quad \\kappa_t^{(n)} > \\theta_\\kappa", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "31700e07-3a21-ca4a-80db-bdd6eda222e8"],
 "\nAnd if you want the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]frictionlessness\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] idea included: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", 
            StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         "reconfiguration loss rate"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "\\chi_t^{(n)} = \\text{reconfiguration loss rate}", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ec1f8474-7914-cb4f-b643-e59ec3f197e5"],
 "\nthen stable systems satisfy: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubsuperscriptBox["\[Chi]", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", 
            StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}]], "\[Rule]", "min", ",    ", 
         FractionBox[
          StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["b", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", 
            StyleBox["n", "TI"], ")"}]], "\[TildeTilde]", "0"}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\chi_t^{(n)} \\to \\min,\\qquad \\frac{d}{dt} b_t^{(n)} \\approx 0", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3aaece73-9a17-2b42-9c07-9b7f5cbbc076"],
 "\nSo in your framework: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     PaneBox["\<\"stability = persistent recursive self-maintenance with \
minimal dissipative loss relative to scale.\"\>",
      BaseStyle->{"Text", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          GrayLevel[0.35], 
          GrayLevel[0.8602474]]},
      ImageMargins->5,
      ImageSize->{Full, Automatic}]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{
        LightDarkSwitched[
         GrayLevel[1], 
         GrayLevel[0.278317]]}}},
   GridBoxDividers->{"ColumnsIndexed" -> {1 -> Directive[
         LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.87, 0.94, 1], 
          RGBColor[0.2491127, 0.3295188, 0.4231198]], 
         AbsoluteThickness[4]]}, "Rows" -> {{False}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}]], 
  "BlockQuote",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"a749070c-727e-584a-adbe-523b72c7ba4f"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"2c99ce32-cabb-5c4c-908d-9930ea4c1b3f"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Q5. What is measurement?\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"b6616d7e-53ba-ff4d-90d3-0c4f76cb0518"],
 "\nThis is one of the strongest parts of your answer.\n\nYou are basically \
saying measurement is not just observer instrumentation. It is: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "the minimal realized pathway of information transfer"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"04b4c989-cd55-6f43-ac28-5faf214b213d"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "outward relation and return relation"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"2a4a1ca2-0d45-2942-9220-3c1f25afd251"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "recursive differentiation of possibility into actuality"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"6b520add-99db-9f4d-ad9b-7be762b90e55"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "self-relation of the field when nothing external exists"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"087aaffd-4fbc-0140-9160-603f0ac472bf"],
 "\nSo RHUFT measurement is closest to: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
