\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d007bf00-d48e-6444-b0c3-8dba1d81c4f7"],

Cell["optimal scan coverage", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"aca2d618-a768-d84b-949d-897b375f48e9"],

Cell["growth law", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"89108443-e472-924d-b6f1-543248af18c7"],

Cell["packing law", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"5080428b-aaa5-0b40-8456-84d3395622b5"],

Cell["anti-resonance schedule", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"91cc45ea-90a1-174e-a273-4a7339538d8b"],

Cell["multiscale phase decorrelation", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f0451ced-e6e2-914e-823c-9d26d75666ad"],

Cell["all or subset", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f41e64bf-6b21-b340-ac75-8299837e82f9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Q10. What is the minimum structural requirement for consciousness?\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"1b1efdf7-95f5-8a44-93d1-1af4a70e5d01"],

Cell["Please rank importance of: ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"86d7cd03-6d42-624e-80d0-522506eb2276"],

Cell["memory", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"67b2d4a5-e155-fe4c-90ee-bb0ccc7c6267"],

Cell["recursive self-model", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"baed6224-3592-1c4c-8da0-081c5fc4f448"],

Cell["prediction", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"8ae02797-e620-a648-8534-9096d27f5602"],

Cell["integration", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"c07a4951-7fbb-d245-9755-31e8481b257f"],

Cell["temporal continuity", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"4ced5546-88c9-8d4f-a13c-b9def4e9fd76"],

Cell["self/world distinction", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"221243b2-dd07-8140-b1a7-1814f75be9f0"],

Cell["embodied closure", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"bde5f94e-1e92-764d-9d34-6a9eb46ce209"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Q11. Is every stable system conscious to some degree, or only self-modeling \
systems?\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"fe4719c0-cd88-0349-95cf-7d29f9371c58"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Q12. Do you intend RHUFT as:", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"f2587f96-74a4-f44c-8d0c-e2105759ae16"],

Cell["metaphysical framework", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f6592d67-6ba7-f940-b7b1-ac19d5f7fd90"],

Cell["computational architecture", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ca6866ab-a284-1d49-b792-6924b0a6fa8e"],

Cell["physical unification attempt", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d0cf0d55-0041-fb46-87e7-ff22e0e73633"],

Cell["consciousness theory", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"5bf44f66-d512-2846-8f86-d89a327d9fd6"],

Cell["all of these in layers", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3e0bbbce-a312-f145-bfca-f76229d69de0"],

